    <sys:String x:Key="S.Gate.Title">Setup required</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.Gate.Intro">WilcoATC needs two models to work: a voice, so the controller can speak, and a recognition model, so it can hear you. Both are free, install once, and run offline afterwards.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.Gate.Voice">Controller voice</sys:String>
